# how to run

CD into this example directory, and run `RUNME-X.sh` and it should use the .env in your current directory

# How To Use This Example

Update the .envs with your directories, the RUNME-X.sh should use the correct env when necessary
After each video is processed it should show you the db in the pyvista SQLiteViewer
Once it merges the two you should see both together, then it should start a server with the new merged database so you can explore
